    "title": "Ruth Atkins \"Cissy\" Sink | Obituaries | dnronline.com",
    "text": "Ruth Atkins \"Cissy\" Sink, 70, of Bridgewater, passed away on Wednesday, December 10, 2025.\nShe was born on April 20, 1955 and was the daughter of the late Clarence and Betty (Shelor) Atkins.\nRuth loved to quilt and sew.\nShe was united in marriage on June 19, 1976 to Howard W. Sink who survives.\nRuth is also survived by brother, Steve Atkins and wife Arlene; numerous special nieces and nephews; and beloved pet, Sparky.\nA service celebrating Ruth's life will be held on Sunday, December 14, 2025 at 2:00 PM at Johnson Funeral and Cremation Service in Bridgewater with Pastor Tina Nelson officiating.\nThe family will receive friends one hour prior to the start of the memorial service.\nArrangements are entrusted to Johnson Funeral and Cremation Service in Bridgewater. Online condolences may be sent to the family at johnsonfs.com.",
